i-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.40<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20120627201709&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Food_Matrix_Crystal_49a87d.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a food matrix crystal.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It contains patterns to create food.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It looks the same as a Memory Crystal.<br/><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Weapon%20Matrix%20Crystal\">Weapon Matrix Crystal</a> </i> </span>\nTemporarily obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">In Service of Yalahar Quest</a>, mission 8. Can be found in a quest box, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32869,31265,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32869, 31265, 10)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before Summer Update 2012, its name was <b>Matrix Crystal</b> and it looked the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">In Service of Yalahar Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a></li><li>Matrix Crystal</li><li>Memory Crystal</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Weapon%20Matrix%20Crystal\">Weapon Matrix Crystal</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["in-service-of-yalahar-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"in-service-of-yalahar-quest","quest":"In Service of Yalahar Quest","step":"10-2","n":55,"title":"Lado bom: Food Matrix Crystal","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32877,"y":31268,"z":7,"label":"Buraco 1"},{"x":32884,"y":31267,"z":8,"label":"Descida 2"},{"x":32887,"y":31278,"z":9,"label":"Descida 3"},{"x":32869,"y":31265,"z":10,"label":"Food Matrix Crystal (porta de quest)"}]},{"slug":"in-service-of-yalahar-quest","quest":"In Service of Yalahar Quest","step":"10-4","n":57,"title":"Ativar a Mysterious Machine","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32879,"y":31268,"z":7,"label":"Buraco para a Mysterious Machine"}]}],"spots":[{"x":32869,"y"